# p_n1_1111: diagnostic. One layer, every seed offset 0x1111. At 12 layers the mask-induced spread swamps
# the observable (GATE-TOLERANCE.md); BumbleBee reads its gate at layer 1. Tests whether SHAFT-CPU has
# that property (draw-changing levers verifiable again).
# Quotes required: unquoted `A=1 B=2` sets SHAFT_N_LAYERS in the sbatch shell only (only SHAFT_LEVERS and
# SHAFT_INNER_ENV reach the container; five 12-layer runs resulted once).
SHAFT_LEVERS=probe_seed_sweep_cpu
SHAFT_INNER_ENV="SHAFT_SEED_OFFSET=0x1111 SHAFT_N_LAYERS=1"
